note bottom of UC001
  One goal, three trigger channels:
  toolbar button, keyboard shortcut,
  context menu (FR-004..FR-006).
  Channel is an alternative trigger,
  not a separate use case.
end note

note bottom of UC004
  The heart of the system.
  Identify -> match rule -> generate
  -> framework-safe write -> events.
  Blocked on DD-003 (data corpus).
end note

note top of UC003
  Blocked on DD-001:
  identifying the right-clicked
  element under on-demand injection.
end note

